Set CPU profile settings for a game. These are applied at game launch, unlike 'cpu governor' and 'cpu smt' which change live system state.

Usage:
  spela cpu set <game> [flags]

Flags:
      --governor string   CPU frequency governor (performance, powersave, schedutil, ondemand)
  -h, --help              help for set
      --smt string        SMT control (on, off, default)
